      "id": "claim_0bfe6fab5a3742b2b4b6c75c12eb5875",
      "statement": "The open-calls pull is a fixed, non-agent pipeline: for each funder it chooses a page (pinned URL, else the page the pull last read a call from, else candidate discovery plus a model pick), reads it through check_url and guarded_client, extracts calls with one structured model call, and writes only calls whose deadline is today or later (Asia/Kolkata); undated and past-deadline calls are only reported.",
